body:
I still get this kind of error in 5.1 with 
```bash
Property '_handleInput' does not exist on type 'DefaultValueAccessor'.
Property '_compositionStart' does not exist on type 'DefaultValueAccessor'.
Property '_compositionEnd' does not exist on type 'DefaultValueAccessor'. Did you mean '_compositionMode'?
```
when doin an AOT build on a simple 
```html
<input [(ngModel)]="value" />
```

where value has Getter and Setter in component, included FormsModule in Module...
```typescript
    @Input()
    public get value(): string {
        return this._value;
    }

    public set value(value: string) {
        if (this._value === value) {
            return;
        }
        this._value = value;
        this._valueChange.emit(value);
        this.cdr.markForCheck();
    }
```

node: 9.2 (docker)
npm: 5.5.1 (docker)
@angular/*: ^5.1.0
@angular/cli: 1.5.5
typescript: ~2.4.2
webpack: ~3.8.1

any ideas or suggestions?
